♪ Diles que ya voy para allá ♪

501
00:29:20,049 --> 00:29:21,968
- ♪ Los obligamos ♪
- ♪ Miau ♪

502
00:29:22,051 --> 00:29:25,972
- ♪ Con mis chicas, vamos a arrasar ♪
- ♪ Miau ♪

503
00:29:26,055 --> 00:29:27,974
♪ Ni huimos ♪
♪ Ni corremos detrás de nadie ♪

504
00:29:29,058 --> 00:29:30,977
♪ Sube el volumen ♪
♪ Escucha el bajo ♪

505
00:29:31,060 --> 00:29:32,979
♪ Won, yen y dólar ♪

506
00:29:33,062 --> 00:29:34,981
♪ Cash, cash, cash ♪

507
00:29:37,734 --> 00:29:38,985
♪ Muévete un poco ♪

508
